-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1gyutr5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">By increasing your muscles’ energy reserves, creatine helps you train harder, recover faster, and build strength more efficiently. It also aids in hydration, reducing muscle fatigue and improving overall performance.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Ra32:-trigger-04013d45-37f6-4216-91f2-9100e5036dba1" id="radix-:Ra32:-content-04013d45-37f6-4216-91f2-9100e5036dba1" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="4da76dfa-46ac-4f74-9621-ae03b9cbf850" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1lq12e8"><picture data-rid="d0d4276d-debf-4e64-8e6a-2dd07ff695b6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-174a23y"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a" alt="Bar graph showing memory performance improvement with creatine in younger and older adults." class="r-lg81ez" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="8bdeea55-fbec-431a-8757-2ddd1c17384e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-3t7gss"><div data-rid="8d6633be-0fcb-4fee-97ae-454e813e13cf" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-jb1lea alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">WHY CREATINE BOOSTS YOUR BRAIN</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="346a17df-9466-4d32-b304-933173fab73c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-xyu9xy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Your brain, like your muscles, relies on energy to function at its best. Creatine helps fuel cognitive processes by increasing ATP production—the brain’s primary energy source.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="efbc6e96-2ac6-46d9-9196-041d78635083" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1736xri alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Studies show that creatine supplementation can improve memory, focus, and mental clarity, especially during stress or fatigue. It also supports brain health over time, making it a powerful tool for both mental performance and long-term cognitive function.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Ra32:-trigger-561c73c8-315d-415f-b410-34a8ad898fa62" id="radix-:Ra32:-content-561c73c8-315d-415f-b410-34a8ad898fa62" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="6892b692-bc3c-4526-806b-123883a78e44" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1hr1ftn"><picture data-rid="38743c87-44a3-4b2b-9a67-2175c539b232" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-6ld9ro"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337" alt="Benefits of creatine include enhanced energy, recovery, hydration, reduced brain fog, better sleep, lower blood sugar, muscle building." class="r-1ms3bwf" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="1cf32165-56ee-485e-b9ab-53df1c3b54eb" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1pgb2ep"><div data-rid="b07973da-1fd1-453e-8019-5cef8948dd7b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-ew2gad alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">WHY CREATINE SUPPORTS OVERALL HEALTH</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="777f7a68-637f-48cb-906a-a5493dbb2657" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1oj0qdk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Creatine isn’t just for workouts—it plays a key role in energy production, muscle preservation, and cellular function. It supports strength, hydration, and recovery while also benefiting brain health, metabolism, and even bone density.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="1865e289-7286-452c-ac10-cc3c2c9b88ce" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-9jh037 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">As we age, natural creatine levels decline, making supplementation a simple way to maintain muscle mass, cognitive function, and overall vitality. It’s a small addition with big benefits for lifelong health.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-replo-marquee-root="true" data-rid="ff54ef47-9815-40b9-ba74-4c9b70471d85" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-1t0gxm0"><div class="r-1ndh51o" data-replo-marquee-track="true"><div data-rid="f2b05752-6948-46e5-82c5-5bef4e038833" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-199cclw"><picture data-rid="10e52313-6a8a-4b90-85a3-1f2ed80ce15a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-ewyd22"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.c